OL,3,APupil arrested after two teachers shot
OL,4,Aat French school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fprincipal and teacher were shot at a
OL,8,Fschool in France on Monday morning.
OL,10,FThe ninth-grade student was detained
OL,11,F"immediately" after the incident at
OL,12,FLakanal middle school, Aubagne Mayor
OL,13,FJean-Pierre Squillari said. French
OL,14,Fmedia reported the suspect was 14.
OL,16,FNo children were harmed and the
OL,17,Fteachers have been treated for injuries
OL,18,Fwhich are not life-threatening,
OL,19,FSquillari added.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
