OL,3,APupil arrested after two teachers shot
OL,4,Aat French school
OL,5,
OL,6,FBroadcaster BFMTV and Le Parisien
OL,7,Freported that the incident was not
OL,8,Fthought to be related to ongoing
OL,9,Fprotests over school conditions, citing
OL,10,Fsources familiar with the
OL,11,Finvestigation.
